    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Sector 7, a forgotten slice of the mega-city where neon lights flicker over rain-slicked concrete. You are a rogue data-runner, and your target is hidden deep within an abandoned corporate safehouse. The megacorp locked down the Mainframe Data Core before evacuating, leaving behind a complex web of encrypted terminals, dead-drop safes, and fragmented data nodes. Your objective is to navigate this digital and physical labyrinth. You must scavenge for override keys, reactivate dormant signal decoders, and daisy-chain their outputs to bypass the heavy biometric locks. Time is ticking, and the automated corporate sweepers are on their way. Trace the data flow, unlock the core, and get out alive.",
